    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41768" root="وخد" body-key="w">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَخَدَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَخِدُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَخْدٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَخَدَانٌ</span>
(S, A, L, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَخِيدٌ</span>, (K,) <i>He</i> (a camel) <i>went
along throwing out his legs like the ostrich:</i> (S,
L, K:) or <i>went quickly:</i> or <i>went with wide steps:</i>
(L, K:) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَدَى</span>: (L:) also said of a horse,
(Kr, L,) and of an ostrtch. (TA.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَصَبَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّيْرَ</span>.

